msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"A standard cruiser modifed for target practice purposes: stronger hull and "
"shields, faster impulse and better maneuverability. Some of these may have "
"slipped out of the automated manufacturing facility to be refurbished for "
"actual militia use."
msgstr ""

