msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Farco 13"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:825
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 13, the maneuver speed is faster, the beams are longer and faster, "
"there's an added longer sniping beam, the tubes load faster, there are more "
"missiles and the shields are stronger."
msgstr ""

