msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "8 sec"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:884
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Fighters are quick, agile ships that do not do a lot of damage, but usually "
"come in larger groups. They are easy to take out, but should not be "
"underestimated. The Fighter II is a more powerful version with stronger "
"beams, hull and shields and an added homing missile tube. All those "
"additions make it a bit slower, though.\n"
"\n"
"Give your science database librarian a big smile. She works hard for you."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:906
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Gnat"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:920
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Gnat is a nimbler version of the Ktlitan Drone. It's got half the hull, "
"but it moves and turns faster"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:940
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Gunship II"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:947
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Adv. Gunship"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:972
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The advanced gunship is a ship equiped with 2 homing missiles to do initial "
"damage and then take out the enemy with 2 front firing beams. It's designed "
"to quickly take out the enemies weaker then itself. Version II has stronger "
"beams, but a weaker hull.\n"
"\n"
"Don't forget to tip your science database librarian."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1001
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "FX64 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1002
#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1049
#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1093
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "MT52 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1020
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The FX64 Hornet is somewhat similar to the MT52 and MU52 models. The beam is "
"longer, narrower and does more damage than both of the other Hornet models. "
"It's max impulse speed and turn speed is faster than both of the other "
"Hornet models. It's hull is weaker"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1048
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "MT55 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1067
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The MT55 Hornet is similar to the 52 series Hornet models. Its speed is "
"faster but it turns more slowly"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1092
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "MV52 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1111
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The MV52 Hornet is very similar to the MT52 and MU52 models. The beam does "
"more damage than both of the other Hornet models, it's max impulse speed is "
"faster than both of the other Hornet models, it turns faster than the MT52, "
"but slower than the MU52"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1152
msgctxt "scienceDB"
